{"data":{"body":"[P2] When `CallbackSender.send` raises after the phase gate is satisfied, this discard is skipped. The callback was already marked handled, so it cannot be retried, while its stale deferred ID blocks history-only completion until timeout and adds a false \u201cawaiting InvocationCompleted\u201d error. Clear the deferred ID before or in a `finally` around delivery, and ensure an accumulated `CallbackError` prevents history-only success; add a failing-sender regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx8773hjE","finding_digest":"c86ba2f87a6e0d208cda8ef652ee92a4022c872c678ed31e46e51adbed9d4fac","finding_id":"arf_v1_zbv2f6d2nygsbdg2r33ff3usuq","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests/validate.py::pollingvalidator.validate::callback-send-failure-stale-phase-state","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests/validate.py::pollingvalidator.validate::callback-send-failure-stale-phase-state","line":800,"observation_digest":"91ebad72a872ca0f2edcfc29673b4880c329a222bce7285d258c99676710ef21","observation_id":"aro_v1_shv224violfa6lw47quwoo2iqd","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests/validate.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-09T00:57:57Z","review_id":"arr_v1_v4c2q7y4dgy3mcp5ulxunjgyta","reviewed_base_sha":"e48ac54502d3c14e2e3fa216c5e200dbb4c14ac2","reviewed_head_sha":"cf325a89d5f1ba3c2d57dbdb71ee6deda778935a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":800,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":131},"record_id":"art_v1_lsqgxlfgwxrop6zx7tzotg4qzh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T00:57:57Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
